# linux-t2-mbp161 — stock Watanare linux-t2 7.2.3.arch1-1 plus yuters e77b03f
# Intel-primary patches 0001–0005. Does not replace linux-t2.
#
# Upstream packaging: NoaHimesaka1873/linux-t2-arch @ vendored (v7.2.3.arch1-1)
# Patches: yuters/mbp161-hybrid-graphics e77b03fe0902216a7544208f2988b4cd391423a1
# Do not use yuters main (Falcon / panel-on-AMD).

